hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1754","Narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Prophet Muhammad (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""On the Day of Resurrection, a big, fat man will come, but he will not be worth even the wing of a mosquito in the sight of Allah."" Then he said: ""Recite this verse (mentioned above): 'So on the Day of Resurrection, We shall assign no weight to them.'"" (This is its meaning, Surah Al-Kahf, verse: 105)"
